@startuml
title UML 用例图：活动票务与报名系统
left to right direction
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho

actor "访客" as Guest
actor "已登录用户" as SignedIn
actor "参与者" as Participant
actor "活动组织者" as Organizer
actor "检票人员" as Checker
actor "平台管理员" as Admin

SignedIn <|-- Participant
SignedIn <|-- Organizer
SignedIn <|-- Checker
SignedIn <|-- Admin

rectangle "活动票务与报名系统" {
  package "访客入口" {
    usecase "浏览/组合查询活动" as Browse
    usecase "注册参与者或组织者" as Register
    usecase "选择身份并登录" as Login
  }
  package "登录后的账号操作" {
    usecase "修改本人密码" as ChangePassword
    usecase "登出" as Logout
  }
  package "参与者业务" {
    usecase "报名与模拟支付" as Buy
    usecase "候补与递补" as Waitlist
    usecase "退票/查看电子票" as Ticket
    usecase "举报活动" as Report
  }
  package "组织者业务" {
    usecase "创建草稿/提交审核" as Submit
    usecase "取消活动/查看统计" as EventStats
    usecase "查看/导出名单" as OrganizerList
  }
  package "检票业务" {
    usecase "验票签到" as CheckIn
    usecase "查看/导出名单" as CheckerList
  }
  package "平台治理" {
    usecase "审核发布/驳回" as Review
    usecase "核查举报/下架" as Remove
    usecase "创建工作人员账号/限制权限" as ManageAccount
    usecase "查看/导出名单" as AdminList
    usecase "查询操作记录" as Audit
  }
}

Guest -- Browse
Guest -- Register
Guest -- Login
SignedIn -- ChangePassword
SignedIn -- Logout
Participant -- Buy
Participant -- Waitlist
Participant -- Ticket
Participant -- Report
Organizer -- Submit
Organizer -- EventStats
Organizer -- OrganizerList
Checker -- CheckIn
Checker -- CheckerList
Admin -- Review
Admin -- Remove
Admin -- ManageAccount
Admin -- AdminList
Admin -- Audit

legend bottom
  已登录用户是四类角色的共同抽象，并非第五种账号。
  访客登录时先选身份，再输入用户名、手机号和密码；登出后返回访客。
  访客仅能自行注册参与者或活动组织者，检票人员和管理员账号由管理员创建。
  检票人员账号由管理员线下交付，系统不设置逐活动授权；该简化口径已确认。
endlegend
@enduml

